SUMMARY:Wimpole Estate: Halloween in the House + Caterpillar trail
LOCATION:Wimpole Estate\, Arrington\, Royston SG8 0BW
DESCRIPTION:National Trust\, ~25 min drive. Halloween in the House 12-3:30pm; Very Hungry Caterpillar trail 9:30am-4pm (both run 1 Oct-1 Nov). Whole Estate ticket: adult £21 / child £10.50 / family £52.50\, free for NT members. https://www.nationaltrust.org.uk/visit/cambridgeshire/wimpole-estate/events/bb855608-d183-4dc9-9974-afad7768cafb
