SUMMARY:Anglesey Abbey: Three Cheers for Pooh! trail & exhibition
LOCATION:Anglesey Abbey\, Lode\, Cambridge CB25 9EJ
DESCRIPTION:National Trust\, ~20 min drive. Garden story trail + Winnie-the-Pooh centenary exhibition\, runs 3 Oct-3 Jan (closed 2-15 Nov). Adult £19 / child £9.50 / family £47.50\, free for NT members. https://www.nationaltrust.org.uk/visit/cambridgeshire/anglesey-abbey-gardens-and-lode-mill/autumn-at-anglesey-abbey
