SUMMARY:Wicken Fen: Fairy Doors and Folklore Family Trail
LOCATION:Wicken Fen\, Lode Lane\, Wicken\, Ely CB7 5XP
DESCRIPTION:National Trust\, ~25 min drive. Self-guided trail round the Woodland Walk\, runs to 9 Nov. Adult £11 / child £5.50 / family £27.50 (plus £3.20 parking)\, free for NT members. https://www.nationaltrust.org.uk/visit/cambridgeshire/wicken-fen-national-nature-reserve
END:VEVENT
